          "id": "26ab0415-1a8e-45cf-a212-a60cbf28847a",
          "name": "Creates and Reads a real time feed of messages and events of your pod (Datahose)",
          "request": {
            "name": "Creates and Reads a real time feed of messages and events of your pod (Datahose)",
            "description": {
              "content": "_Available on Agent 22.5.1 and above._\n\nThis API provides a real time feed of all the messages and events in the pod, \neven from conversations where the calling service account is not a member. The types of events surfaced \ncan be found in the Real Time Events list.\nIn case you retrieving SOCIALMESSAGE events, the credentials of the ceservice \naccount must be properly configured in the Agent.\n\nThe types of events returned can be found in the Real Time\nEvents list (see definition on top of the file). \n\nThe ackId sent as parameter must be empty for the first call. In the response an ackId will be sent back\nand it can be used for the next call: in this way you acknowledge that\nyou have received the events that came with that ackId.\n\nIf you have several instances of the same bot, they must share the same feed so \nthat events are spread across all bot instances. To do so, you must: share the same \nservice account provide the same \"tag\" and same \"filters\" values.\n\nThe Datahose API is an add-on to the Symphony Services, and is subject to additional charges. \nPrior to using Datahose in your Symphony environment(s), you will need to enter into a specific contract.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v5",
                "events",
                "read"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "disabled": false,
                "description": "(Required) Session authentication token.",
                "key": "sessionToken",
                "value": "<string>"
              },
              {
                "disabled": false,
                "description": "Key Manager authentication token.",
                "key": "keyManagerToken",
                "value": "<string>"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "POST",
            "auth": null,
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"tag\": \"<string>\",\n  \"type\": \"<string>\",\n  \"eventTypes\": [\n    \"<string>\",\n    \"<string>\"\n  ],\n  \"scopes\": [\n    \"<string>\",\n    \"<string>\"\n  ],\n  \"ackId\": \"<string>\",\n  \"updatePresence\": true\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "fe973293-f161-47ef-8663-1f7820433042",
